story","categoryLabel":"Sports","contentSummaries":{"summary":"In the 23 NBA seasons that he has played so far, LeBron James has won four championships. While he is now with the Philadelphia 76ers after signing a two-year, $8 million contract , there is one part of his 2020 title run with the Los Angeles Lakers that he still wishes he could have experienced. The Lakers never got to celebrate their championship […] The post Lakers news: LeBron James still wishes LA had 2020 championship parade appeared first on ClutchPoints."},"adMeta":{"hashtag":"nba;basketball;sports;opinion_and_editorial;historical_moments;culture;milestones;transaction;team_profiles;player_profiles","rs":"lmsid:a0Va6000001mTITEA2;revsp:clutchpoints_articles_939;lpstaid:53772c9b-9c8d-3421-85d9-0ed81fc3f597;pct:story","site_attribute":""},"contentTags":{"normalizedTags":{"yfrontpage":{"region":["us"]},"ymedia":{"signal":["summary_source:provider"],"category":["100000002","100000008"],"provider_category":["Los Angeles Lakers","LeBron James"],"hosted":["yes"],"provider_id":["clutchpoints_articles_939"]},"ysports":{"region":["us"]}}},"attribution":{"authors":[{"name":"Nitish Singh, ClutchPoints","alias":"","title":"","description":"","id":"","logo":null,"social":{"email":null,"facebookId":null,"instagramId":null,"tiktokId":null,"website":null,"twitter":null}}],"provider":{"name":"ClutchPoints"}},"commentsAllowed":true}}}</script></div></div></div><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push(["https://s.yimg.com/aaq/f10d509c/d2ftq0ol13ke77.js",{}])</script><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push(["https://s.yimg.com/du/benji/benji-2.3.425.js",{}])</script><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src="https://s.yimg.com/xe/next-app-sports/_next/static/chunks/webpack-91bb2e4dac79.js" crossorigin="" id="_R_" async=""></script><div hidden id="S:0"><div class="share-wrapper"><button aria-controls="_R_2cmjplh9av5ubsqlb_" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="m