$RC=function(a,b){if(b=document.getElementById(b))(a=document.getElementById(a))?(a.previousSibling.data="$~",$RB.push(a,b),2===$RB.length&&("number"!==typeof $RT?requestAnimationFrame($RV.bind(null,$RB)):(a=performance.now(),setTimeout($RV.bind(null,$RB),2300>a&&2E3<a?2300-a:$RT+300-a)))):b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RC("B:0","S:0")</script><div hidden id="S:1"><div class="content-body"><p><a data-ylk="slk:Lakers news: LeBron James still wishes LA had 2020 championship parade;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Lakers news: LeBron James still wishes LA had 2020 championship parade&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/nba/los-angeles-lakers/lakers-news-lebron-james-2020-championship-parade" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><em>Lakers news: LeBron James still wishes LA had 2020 championship parade</em></a><em> appeared first on </em><a data-ylk="slk:ClutchPoints;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;ClutchPoints&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><em>ClutchPoints</em></a><em>. Add ClutchPoints as a </em><a data-ylk="slk:Preferred Source by clicking here;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Preferred Source by clicking here&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=clutchpoints.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><em>Preferred Source by clicking here</em></a><em>.</em></p><p>In the 23 NBA seasons that he has played so far, <a data-ylk="slk:LeBron James;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;LeBron James&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/nba/players/b1a9094f/lebron-james" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">LeBron James</a> has won four championships. While he is now <a data-ylk="slk:with the Philadelphia 76ers after signing a two-year, $8 million contract;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;with the Philadelphia 76ers after signing a two-year, $8 million contract&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/nba/philadelphia-76ers/76ers-news-lebron-james-new-sixers-deal-passes-russell-westbrook-in-nba-history" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">with the Philadelphia 76ers after signing a two-year, $8 million contract</a>, there is one part of his 2020 title run with the <a data-ylk="slk:Los Angeles Lakers;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Los Angeles Lakers&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/nba/los-angeles-lakers" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Los Angeles Lakers</a> that he still wishes he could have experienced.</p><div class="sda-placeholder-txt">Advertisement</div><div class="bodyad-wrapper hidden" id="sda-body"><div class="sda-text">Advertisement</div><div class="body-ads" id="sda-bodysda"><div class="responsive-sda" id="_R_678jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_"><div class="hidden" id="_R_678jplh9av5ubsqlb_"></div><div class="sda-text" style="height:250px;width:300px">Advertisement</div><style type="text/css">#_R_678jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_ { display: none; }
