        #_R_678jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_ { display: flex; }
        iframe { max-width: 100vw; }
      }</style></div></div></div><p>The Lakers never got to celebrate their championship with a traditional parade because of COVID-19 restrictions. Six years later, James <a data-ylk="slk:still thinks about what that celebration could have looked like;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;still thinks about what that celebration could have looked like&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://x.com/NBA__Courtside/status/2103487056483606891" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">still thinks about what that celebration could have looked like</a>.</p><p>&quot;That bothers me 1 to 10. 20 like just to be able to celebrate with the Laker faithful,&quot; he recently said on Mind the Game podcast. &quot;I don&#x27;t know what the route would have been. I&#x27;m thinking go down Olympic just like all the way down Olympic and then end up downtown right by Staple Center. They want to call it Crypto and sh*t, I call it Staple Center to me. It would have been super duper dope, man. But yeah, we did that. We did that. And that banner is up there. That banner is in that arena forever along with the other ones that been able to go up in the history of the Lakers Franchise.&quot;</p><p><strong><em>Watch sports LIVE with </em></strong><a data-ylk="slk:fuboTV (free trial);elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;fuboTV (free trial)&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.fubo.tv/lp/sports/?irad=368998&amp;irmp=492408" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><strong><em>fuboTV (free trial)</em></strong></a></p><section class="consent"><div class="card-loader relative mb-2.5 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2px] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_2px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,.08),0-1px_3px_0_rgba(0,0,0,.06)] before:block before:h-[110px] before:bg-dirty-seagull before:content-[&#x27;_&#x27;] after:absolute after:left-0 after:top-0 after:size-full after:content-[&#x27;_&#x27;]" data-testid="loader" style="aspect-ratio:1.10"><div class="mb-2.5 mt-6 h-full bg-placeholder-text bg-[length:40px_40px]"></div></div></section><p>The 2019-20 Lakers won the championship inside the NBA&#x27;s Orlando bubble after the league suspended the season for several months during the pandemic. The team eventually returned to action in a closed environment at Walt Disney World, where the Lakers beat the <a data-ylk="" data-yga="{&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="/nba/teams/miami/" rel="">Miami Heat</a> in the NBA Finals.</p><figure class="content-figure"><div class="content-image"><a data-ylk="pkgt:image;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:img;" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" href="https://bit.ly/ClutchGoogle"><img alt="Add ClutchPoints on Google" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" width="960" height="540" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="standard-img" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/34b96b736a762ad34d0273596356e05f6509786d0a6d6f44103db40b7c1d8c8e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fclutchpoints_articles_939%2F31ecd53134bb05c09cd978e6736c6f0a"/></a></div><figcaption class="fig-caption"><div style="max-height:none;overflow:visible">Add ClutchPoints on Google</div></figcaption></figure><p>The title also came during a difficult year for the Lakers organization following the <a data-ylk="slk:death of Kobe Bryant in January 2020;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;death of Kobe Bryant in January 2020&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/nba/los-angeles-lakers/lakers-news-kobe-bryant-killed-helicopter-crash" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">death of Kobe Bryant in January 2020</a>.<br/>James has often pointed to the unique challenges of that postseason when discussing the championship. Players spent months away from their families and played without fans in the arena.</p><div class="sda-placeholder-txt">Advertisement</div><div class="bodyad-wrapper hidden" id="sda-body"><div class="sda-text">Advertisement</div><div class="body-ads" id="sda-bodysda"><div class="responsive-sda" id="_R_6n8jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_"><div class="hidden" id="_R_6n8jplh9av5ubsqlb_"></div><div class="sda-text" style="height:250px;width:300px">Advertisement</div><style type="text/css">#_R_6n8jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_ { display: none; }
@media screen and (max-width: 767.95px) {
        #_R_6n8jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_ { display: flex; }
        iframe { max-width: 100vw; }
      }</style></div></div></div><p>The Lakers did eventually raise the 2020 championship banner at Crypto.com Arena.</p><p><em>Related: </em><a data-ylk="slk:What Lakers&#x27; Rob Pelinka said about LeBron James&#x27; exit to start season intro presser;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;What Lakers&#x27; Rob Pelinka said about LeBron James&#x27; exit to start season intro presser&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/nba/los-angeles-lakers/lakers-news-rob-pelinka-lebron-james-exit-season-intro-presser" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><em>What Lakers&#x27; Rob Pelinka said about LeBron James&#x27; exit to start season intro presser</em></a></p><p><em>Related: </em><a data-ylk="slk:JJ Redick gushes over Walker Kessler&#x27;s &#x27;perfect fit&#x27; with Luka Doncic, Austin Reaves;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;JJ Redick gushes over Walker Kessler&#x27;s &#x27;perfect fit&#x27; with Luka Doncic, Austin Reaves&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://clutchpoints.com/nba/los-angeles-lakers/lakers-news-jj-redick-gushes-walker-kessler-perfect-fit-luka-doncic-austin-reaves" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><em>JJ Redick gushes over Walker Kessler&#x27;s &#x27;perfect fit&#x27; with Luka Doncic, Austin Reaves</em></a></p></div></div><script>$RC("B:1","S:1")</script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n3:I[57121,[],\"\"]\n4:I[74581,[],\"\"]\n1a:I[26719,[\"4219\",\"static/chunks/app/global-error-dfcd29020e19.js\"],\"default\"]\n:HL[\"https://s.yimg.com/xe/next-app-sports/_next/static/css/f231d8ef7813.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n:HL[\"https:/