\"nodeId\":\"15\",\"parentNodeId\":\"8\",\"text\":\" that he still wishes he could have experienced.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"__typename\":\"CBodyItem\",\"locationNumber\":1,\"subtype\":\"in-body\",\"type\":\"ad\"},{\"nodeId\":\"16\",\"parentNodeId\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":200},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"17\",\"parentNodeId\":\"16\",\"text\":\"The Lakers never got to celebrate their championship with a traditional parade because of COVID-19 restrictions. Six years later, James \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"nodeId\":\"18\",\"parentNodeId\":\"16\",\"text\":\"still thinks about what that celebration could have looked like\",\"type\":\"text\",\"attrs\":{\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://x.com/NBA__Courtside/status/2103487056483606891\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"class\":null,\"title\":null,\"isValidAffiliate\":null,\"isDoNotAffiliateLink\":false,\"dataOriginalLink\":null,\"data-autolinker-wiki-id\":null,\"dataYlk\":{\"slk\":\"still thinks about what that celebration could have looked like\",\"elm\":\"context_link\",\"itc\":\"0\",\"sec\":\"content-canvas\"},\"data-ylk\":\"{\\\"slk\\\":\\\"still thinks about what that celebration could have looked like\\\",\\\"elm\\\":\\\"context_link\\\",\\\"itc\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"sec\\\":\\\"content-canvas\\\"}\"}}]}},{\"nodeId\":\"19\",\"parentNodeId\":\"16\",\"text\":\".\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"nodeId\":\"20\",\"parentNodeId\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":594},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"21\",\"parentNodeId\":\"20\",\"text\":\"\\\"That bothers me 1 to 10. 20 like just to be able to celebrate with the Laker faithful,\\\" he recently said on Mind the Game podcast. \\\"I don't know what the route would have been. I'm thinking go down Olympic just like all the way down Olympic and then end up downtown right by Staple Center. They want to call it Crypto and sh*t, I call it Staple Center to me. It would have been super duper dope, man. But yeah, we did that. We did that. And that banner is up there. That banner is in that arena forever along with the other ones that been able to go up in the history of the Lakers Franchise.\\\"\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"nodeId\":\"22\",\"parentNodeId\":null,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":42},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"23\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"text\":\"Watch sports LIVE with \",\"type\":\"text\",\"attrs\":{\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}},{\"nodeId\":\"24\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"text\":\"fuboTV (free trial)\",\"type\":\"text\",\"attrs\":{\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.fubo.tv/lp/sports/?irad=368998\u0026irmp=492408\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"class\":null,\"title\":null,\"isValidAffiliate\":null,\"isDoNotAffiliateLink\":false,\"dataOriginalLink\":null,\"data-autolinker-wiki-id\":null,\"dataYlk\":{\"slk\":\"fuboTV (free trial)\",\"elm\":\"context_link\",\"itc\":\"0\",\"sec\":\"content-canvas\"},\"data-ylk\":\"{\\\"slk\\\":\\\"fuboTV (free trial)\\\",\\\"elm\\\":\\\"context_link\\\",\\\"itc\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"sec\\\":\\\"content-canvas\\\"}\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}}]},{\"nodeId\":\"25\",\"parentNodeId\":null,\"type\":\"tweet\",\"id\":\"2103487056483606891\",\"items\":[{\"markup\":\"\u003cblockquote class=\\\"twitter-tweet\\\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\"\u003eLeBron James says he still thinks about not being able to do the parade after winning the championship in 2020:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“That bothers me 1 to 10. 20 like just to be able to celebrate with the Laker faithful. I don’t know what the route would have been. I’m thinking go down Olympic just… \u003ca href=\\\"https://t.co/poxzft6L1j\\\"\u003epic.twitter.com/poxzft6L1j\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e— NBA Courtside (@NBA__Courtside) \u003ca href